@baseUrl = https://localhost:7024

# ── IDs — update these as you run through the story ──────────────────────────
# OI Horizon (created in step 1.1)
@vesselId      = c9e67852-2e78-4017-82ab-fc5977f84f7d
# Oceanic Surveys Ltd (step 2.1)
@customerId    = 1
# North Sea Survey 2026 (step 2.2)
@projectId     = 2
# OI Horizon ↔ project link (step 3.1)
@allocationId  = 1
# EM 2040 (step 1.2)
@mbesId        = mbes-001
# APC PDU (step 1.3)
@pduId         = pdu-001
# Applanix POS MV (step 1.4)
@insId         = ins-001

# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# │  STORY: North Sea Survey 2026
# │
# │  1. Register the vessel and its payload sensors
# │  2. Onboard the customer and create the project
# │  3. Allocate the vessel to the project
# │  4. Mount sensors on the allocation
# │  5. Activate the project and confirm the setup
# │  6. Issue operational commands to the sensors
# │  7. Monitor live sensor readings
# │  8. Wrap up: remove equipment, deallocate vessel, close project
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 1  Register the vessel and its sensors
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1.1 — Create vessel  (copy returned vesselId → @vesselId above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vessels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "OI Horizon",
  "vesselType": "SURVEY",
  "bridgePhoneNumber": "+44-1234-567890",
  "captainEmail": "captain.jones@oi.com",
  "surveyEmail": "survey@oi.com"
}

###

### 1.2 — Register MBES sensor  (mbes-001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "mbes-001",
  "displayName": "Kongsberg EM 2040",
  "payloadType": "MBES",
  "manufacturer": "Kongsberg",
  "model": "EM 2040",
  "serialNumber": "EM2040-SN-8821",
  "label": "hull-center"
}

###

### 1.3 — Register PDU  (pdu-001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "pdu-001",
  "displayName": "APC PDU Survey Rack",
  "payloadType": "PDU",
  "manufacturer": "APC",
  "model": "AP8841",
  "serialNumber": "AP8841-SN-0042",
  "label": "survey-rack-port"
}

###

### 1.4 — Register INS  (ins-001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "ins-001",
  "displayName": "Applanix POS MV",
  "payloadType": "INS",
  "manufacturer": "Applanix",
  "model": "POS MV WaveMaster II",
  "serialNumber": "POSMV-SN-5577",
  "label": "survey-rack-starboard"
}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 2  Onboard the customer and create the project
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2.1 — Create customer  (copy returned id → @customerId above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oceanic Surveys Ltd",
  "taxNumber": "GB987654321",
  "billingCountry": "GB",
  "billingCurrencyIso": "GBP",
  "parentId": null
}

###

### 2.2 — Create project in PLANNED status  (copy returned id → @projectId above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "North Sea Survey 2026",
  "customerId": 1,
  "region": "North Sea",
  "opStartDate": "2026-06-01",
  "opEndDate": "2026-09-30",
  "numVesselDays": 120,
  "projectType": "SURVEY",
  "projectStatus": "PLANNED",
  "pidSalesforce": null
}

###

### 2.3 — Confirm project was created
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 3  Allocate the vessel to the project
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3.1 — Allocate OI Horizon as primary vessel  (copy returned id → @allocationId above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vesselId": "{{vesselId}}",
  "role": "PRIMARY",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-30"
}


###

### 3.2 — List allocations for the project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 4  Mount sensors on the allocation
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 4.1 — Mount MBES (primary multibeam)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "mbes-001",
  "mountLocation": "hull-center",
  "usage": "PRIMARY",
  "desiredHardwareParams": null
}

###

### 4.2 — Mount PDU (powers the survey rack)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "pdu-001",
  "mountLocation": "survey-rack-port",
  "usage": "PRIMARY",
  "desiredHardwareParams": null
}

###

### 4.3 — Mount INS (positioning and motion)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "ins-001",
  "mountLocation": "survey-rack-starboard",
  "usage": "PRIMARY",
  "desiredHardwareParams": null
}

###

### 4.4 — Confirm all equipment is mounted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/equipment

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 5  Activate the project
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5.1 — Transition project: PLANNED → ACTIVE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectStatus": "ACTIVE"
}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 6  Issue operational commands to sensors
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 6.1 — PDU: power on outlet 1 (bring up the survey rack)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/commands/pdu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "pdu-001",
  "vesselId": "{{vesselId}}",
  "issuedBy": "survey.operator@oi.com",
  "outletIndex": 1,
  "action": "ON",
  "sequenceDelayS": null
}

###

### 6.2 — INS: start alignment
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/commands/ins
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#   "payloadId": "ins-001",
#   "vesselId": "{{vesselId}}",
#   "issuedBy": "survey.operator@oi.com",
#   "action": "ALIGN"
# }

###

### 6.3 — MBES: configure and start pinging
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/commands/mbes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "mbes-001",
  "vesselId": "{{vesselId}}",
  "issuedBy": "survey.operator@oi.com",
  "frequencyKhz": 300.0,
  "beamAngleDeg": 130.0,
  "angleCorrectionDeg": 0.0,
  "operatingMode": "EQUIDISTANT",
  "powerLevel": "NORMAL"
}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 7  Monitor live sensor readings
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 7.1 — Latest reading for every sensor on the vessel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/readings/payload/latest?vesselId={{vesselId}}

###

### 7.2 — Latest MBES reading
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/readings/mbes/latest?vesselId={{vesselId}}

###

### 7.3 — Latest PDU reading
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/readings/pdu/latest?vesselId={{vesselId}}

###

### 7.4 — MBES time-series (most recent 20 records)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/readings/mbes?vesselId={{vesselId}}&limit=20

###

### 7.5 — MBES time-series for a specific payload (cursor-based, next page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/readings/mbes?payloadId={{mbesId}}&before=2026-06-15T12:00:00Z&limit=20

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# § 8  Wrap up: shutdown sensors, deallocate vessel, close project
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 8.1 — MBES: stop pinging
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/commands/mbes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "mbes-001",
  "vesselId": "{{vesselId}}",
  "issuedBy": "survey.operator@oi.com",
  "operatingMode": "PASSIVE"
}

###

### 8.2 — PDU: power off outlet 1 (shutdown survey rack)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/commands/pdu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payloadId": "pdu-001",
  "vesselId": "{{vesselId}}",
  "issuedBy": "survey.operator@oi.com",
  "outletIndex": 1,
  "action": "OFF",
  "sequenceDelayS": 5
}

###

### 8.3 — Remove MBES from allocation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/equipment/1

###

### 8.4 — Remove PDU from allocation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/equipment/2

###

### 8.5 — Remove INS from allocation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}/equipment/3

###

### 8.6 — Deallocate OI Horizon from the project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/allocations/{{allocationId}}

###

### 8.7 — Transition project: ACTIVE → COMPLETED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectStatus": "COMPLETED"
}

###

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
